Steps to build NEMO_3D for CrayXT platform. Special instructions are needed
because of the frontend/backend nature of the computing environment.

1. set BUILD_TYPE = crayxt_frontend_pgi_fast in make.inc

2. make xercesc XMLtoC
   Because shared object libraries are not allowed the following error will result:
      make[2]: *** [..../NEMO_3D/build/../xerces-c-src2_1_0/lib/libxerces-c.so.21.0] Error 1
      make[2]: Target `ALL' not remade because of errors.
      make[2]: Leaving directory `..../NEMO_3D/xerces-c-src2_1_0/obj'
      make[1]: *** [..../NEMO_3D/build/../xerces-c-src2_1_0/lib/libxerces-c.21.0] Error 2
      make[1]: Leaving directory `..../NEMO_3D/xerces-c-src2_1_0/src/xercesc'
      make: *** [..../NEMO_3D/build/../xerces-c-src2_1_0/lib/libxerces-c_x86_64_crayxt_frontend_pgi_fast.a] Error 2
   This is not a problem because the library libxerces-c.so.21.0 is not used anyway.

3. touch ../xerces-c-src2_1_0/lib/libxerces-c.so.21.0

4. make xercesc XMLtoC
   Completion of step 2.

5. make cleanall_xercesc clean_XMLtoC
   Erase to force rebuild for backend.

6. set BUILD_TYPE = crayxt_backend_pgi_fast in make.inc

7. make
   This will fail like step 2.

8. touch ../xerces-c-src2_1_0/lib/libxerces-c.so.21.0

9. make
   Because backend executable XMLtoC cannot run on the frontend the following error will result:
      mv *.[CH] ..../NEMO_3D/XMLtoC/apps/ioNemo3D/src;
      mv: cannot stat `*.[CH]': No such file or directory
      make[1]: *** [bldapp] Error 1
      make[1]: Leaving directory `..../NEMO_3D/XMLtoC'
      make: *** [..../NEMO_3D/build/../XMLtoC/apps/ioNemo3D/lib/x86_64_crayxt_backend_pgi_fast/libioNemo3D-x86_64_crayxt_backend_pgi_fast.a] Error 2

10. cd ../XMLtoC/bin

11. cp XMLtoC-x86_64_crayxt_frontend_pgi_fast.ex XMLtoC-x86_64_crayxt_backend_pgi_fast.ex

12. cd ../../build

13. make

